@startuml
' A <style> for a state diagram, its legend and its main frame.
<style>
stateDiagram {
  state {
    BackGroundColor #EEF6EE
    LineColor #3C8D3C
    FontStyle bold
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #3C8D3C
    LineThickness 1.5
  }
}
legend {
  BackGroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #3C8D3C
  RoundCorner 0
}
mainframe {
  LineColor #3C8D3C
  FontStyle bold
}
</style>
mainframe state Order
[*] --> New
New --> Paid : pay
Paid --> Shipped : ship
Shipped --> [*]
legend right
  Happy path only
endlegend
@enduml
